# Exercises the Support Assistant against the compose stack (`make up`), as the demo Customer,
# directly and through the gateway. Run the token request first; it stores the token for the ones
# after it. With the anthropic-api-key secret empty, as `make secrets` (which `make up` runs) writes it, the mock provider
# answers. Asked where their Order is, it names the demo Customer's latest Order, or says they have
# none: check one out in the Storefront first to see it.

@assistant = http://localhost:8102
@gateway = http://localhost:8000
@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/ecomm/protocol/openid-connect/token

### The demo Customer's token
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=demo@ecomm.local&password=demo

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Start a Conversation: 201, empty
POST {{assistant}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

> {% client.global.set("conversationId", response.body.id); %}

### Ask where their Order is: the reply names the latest Order, and references it
POST {{assistant}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Where is my order?"}

### Ask something else: answered without a lookup
POST {{assistant}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Hello!"}

### An empty message: 400 invalidMessage
POST {{assistant}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": ""}

### The transcript, through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/support-assistant/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### End it: 204
DELETE {{assistant}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Ended, it is gone: 404
GET {{assistant}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
